     <p style="line-height: 2em;">全体教职工：</p><p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 2em;">根据市教育局党委开展2025年度市直学校领导干部述职评议的通知要求，落实学校领导班子及班子成员的述职情况展示。按照文件要求，班子履职情况及学校主要领导的述职报告将在全校教工大会上进行现场报告，其他班子成员的述职报告通过书面形式在校网展示，请老师们悉知。</p><p>
</p><p style="text-align: right;">党政办    </p><p style="text-align: right;">2026年2月9日</p><p style="text-align: right;">
</p><p style="text-align: right;">
</p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正小标宋简体;font-size:29px">202</span><span style=";font-family:方正小标宋简体;font-size:29px">5</span><span style=";font-family:方正小标宋简体;font-size:29px">年度述职述廉述德述法报告</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:39px"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体">绍兴市第一中学副校长</span><span style="font-family:楷体">杨佩琼</span></span></p><h6 style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:39px"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 21px">2026年2月</span></h6><h6><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"> </span></h6><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2025</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年，我在绍兴一中担任党委委员、纪委书记、副校长、年管会主任等职。全年始终以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为指导，深入贯彻党的教育方针，紧扣教育部“基础教育规范管理提升年”行动要求与绍兴市“基础教育扩优提质行动计划”部署，认真履行“一岗双责”，核心承担纪检监察、德育工作、体艺、党风廉政建设及年段管理工作（</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2025</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年上半年分管高一年段，下半年分管高二年段），同时坚守数学教学一线。在校长、书记的领导下，与班子成员团结协作，以“博雅育人”为核心，踏踏实实推进各项分管工作落地见效。现将本年度履职情况汇报如下，请予评议。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">一、铸魂育人，深耕德育与体艺融合发展</span></strong></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（一）深化德育品牌，筑牢育人根基</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">紧扣绍兴市</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“越思政”育人体系建设要求，深化“博雅德育”品牌内涵，推动德育工作与“扩优提质”目标深度融合。优化德育工作机制，明确德育处与年段管委会“统筹规划</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">+</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">具体执行”的协同分工，修订《德育工作考核细则》，将学生行为养成、活动参与、品格发展纳入量化评价，让德育管理更规范、更细致。全年组织“博雅大讲堂”</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">10</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">场，邀请院士专家、高校学者授课，覆盖学生</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2000</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">余人次，帮助学生开阔视野、涵养品格。学校获评</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2024</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">学年绍兴市级德育工作优秀集体，德育工作成效得到上级部门认可。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">强化德育队伍建设，延续</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“德育师徒结对”模式，升级“博雅养新班主任工作坊”，开展专题培训</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">4</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">期，覆盖班主任及后备力量</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">120</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">余人次。依托王卫列校友基金“育人楷模”评选，选树优秀班主任典型，健全考核激励机制，鼓励德育教师参与课题研究、案例评比与技能竞赛。</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2025</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年，我校班主任收获多项成绩：陈忆宁荣获绍兴市中小学班会课一等奖，郭志威获绍兴市班主任基本功大赛二等奖，</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">人获评市直学校优秀班主任，德育团队专业能力稳步提升。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">丰富德育活动载体，打造</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“追梦与守志”“感恩与奉献”“广博与雅正”三大主题体系。结合重要时间节点，组织纪念抗战胜利</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">80</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">周年、国家宪法日、五四青年节等主题教育活动</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">12</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">场，开展“国旗在我心中”“胆剑魂青春梦”合唱比赛等特色活动，厚植学生家国情怀。深化“劳动教育</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">+</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">科技育人”融合模式，组织</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">700</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">余名学生参与寒暑假职业体验，学生金易楠领衔的《基于环境</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">DNA</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">宏条形码技术调查浙江省曹娥江硅藻种群结构及水生态健康》项目，斩获第二十二届全国水科技发明比赛总决赛一等奖（全省唯一）。评选“十佳博雅少年”“优秀共青团干部”等先进典型，学生在浙江省艺术节、绍兴市文艺汇演等赛事中屡获佳绩，雅正人格培育取得实实在在的效果。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（二）提质体艺活动，促进全面发展</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">聚焦</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“五育并举”目标，推动体艺教育与德育深度融合，丰富校园文化生活。完善体艺课程体系，优化课程设置，开设舞蹈、器乐、绘画、书法、球类等特色体艺课程</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">15</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">门，满足学生个性化发展需求。认真组织体艺活动，成功举办军体运动会、校园艺术节、合唱比赛等大型活动，组织学生参与各级各类体艺竞赛，取得了不错的成绩：浙江省艺术节乐器类一等奖、绘画类二等奖、书法类二等奖；绍兴市文艺汇演二等奖、绍兴市直合唱比赛一等奖；绍兴市军训会操一等奖、绍兴市救护技能二等奖，学生综合素质得到全面提升。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">二、严督实导，筑牢纪检与党风廉政防线</span></strong></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（一）强化纪检监督，护航校园发展</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">作为省级清廉学校核心建设者，我严格履行纪检监察职责，聚焦学校预算执行、物资采购、职称评聘、招生考试等七大重点领域，健全内控管理制度，推进决策民主化、公开化。全年开展廉洁教育活动</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">4</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">场，组织教职工学习党纪法规、典型案例，筑牢思想防线；对学校重大事项决策、关键岗位履职情况进行全程监督，受理师生诉求</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">12</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">件，办结率</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">100%</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，确保权力运行公开透明。持续深化清廉学校建设，营造风清气正的育人环境，学校未发生任何违规违纪问题。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（二）抓实党风廉政，压实主体责任</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">牵头推进学校党风廉政建设，制定年度党风廉政建设工作方案，明确责任分工，层层压实</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“一岗双责”。组织党委理论学习中心组学习</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">12</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">次，专题学习党风廉政建设相关精神，开展廉政谈话、警示教育等活动，引导党员干部严守纪律底线。完善党风廉政建设考核机制，将考核结果与评优评先、职称晋升挂钩，强化结果运用。加强廉政文化建设，打造清廉校园宣传阵地，通过校园广播、宣传栏、主题班会等形式，营造崇廉尚洁的校园氛围，推动党风廉政建设与教育教学工作深度融合。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">三、精细管理，扎实推进年段育人提质</span></strong></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2025</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年，我上半年分管高一年级、下半年分管高二年级，始终围绕不同年段学生成长特点开展工作，把常规管理抓细抓实，带动三个年段协同提升，学生精神面貌与校纪校风持续向好。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">日常工作中，注重抓好学生行为规范养成，将跑操等常规活动作为培养学生集体意识、规则意识的重要载体，通过明确基本要求、班主任跟班督促、体育教师指导等方式，逐步提升活动质量，让学生在日常锻炼中锤炼作风。</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">针对不同年段学生需求精准发力：上半年面对高一年级新生适应期特点，组织入学仪式、学业规划讲座、心理健康团辅等活动</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">6</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">场，帮助学生快速融入高中生活；下半年聚焦高二年级学业分化关键期，开展“博雅少年分享会”“学科方法指导课”等活动</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">4</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">场，助力学生明确发展方向。强化全学段行为养成教育，完善值周班量化考核制度，推进学生自主管理。关注“四特”学生成长，牵头建立跨年级“四特”学生档案，联合班主任、心理教师、家长开展协同帮扶，落实每月家访与个性化辅导制度。强化心理健康教育，组织心理健康月、心理游园会等活动，开展跨年级心理团辅</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">10</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">余场，帮助学生缓解心理压力。</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2025</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年，董满达、李世钰两位学生荣获绍兴市高中生生涯规划大赛一等奖，分管年段校纪校风持续向好，育人质量稳步提升。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">四、深耕教学，坚守一线育人初心</span></strong></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">始终坚守教学一线，深耕数学教学业务，以过硬的专业能力助力学生成长。</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2025</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年上半年，担任高一年级创新班数学教学工作，紧扣创新人才培养目标，钻研教材教法，注重思维能力与学科素养培育，所带班级数学学业成绩优秀，下半年，结合年段分工调整，担任高二年级物化政组合班级（</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">58</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">人）数学教学工作，该班级接手时数学成绩位列普通班倒数第三。面对基础薄弱、学情复杂的现状，我坚持“因材施教、精准发力”：通过学情调研全面摸清学生知识短板，制定“基础巩固</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">+</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">能力提升”分层辅导方案；利用课余时间给他们辅导上课，组建学生互助学习小组，注重培养学生的数学思维与解题能力；加强与科任教师协同沟通，形成育人合力。经过一学期的努力，该班级数学成绩大幅提升，期末总成绩跃升至普通班前茅，学生学习信心与班级凝聚力显著增强，赢得师生与家长的广泛认可。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">五、修德律己，锤炼过硬作风素养</span></strong></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（一）强化理论学习，提升政治站位</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">坚持把政治学习放在首位，深入学习习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想、习近平总书记关于教育的重要论述，以及教育部、绍兴市教育工作部署，全年参与党委理论学习中心组学习</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">33</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">次，不断提高政治判断力、政治领悟力、政治执行力，确保分管工作始终沿着正确方向推进。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（二）严守廉洁底线，恪守职业操守</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">严格遵守中央八项规定精神及廉洁自律各项规定，自觉净化社交圈、生活圈、朋友圈，不利用职务之便谋取私利。在招生录取、职称评聘、物资采购等工作中，坚持原则、秉公办事，主动接受师生、家长及社会监督。注重家风建设，教育引导家人廉洁自律，树立良好的个人形象。</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（三）坚持依法履职，提升法治素养</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">深入学习《教育法》《教师法》《未成年人保护法》《监察法》等法律法规，全年参与法治专题学习</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">次，将法治思维融入德育管理、纪检监督、教学工作全过程。在学生管理中，坚持依法依规办事，保障学生合法权益；在监督执纪中，严格按照程序开展工作，确保各项工作合法合规。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（四）注重团结协作，锤炼务实作风</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">始终坚持民主集中制，主动与班子成员沟通协作，大事讲原则、小事讲风格，形成工作合力。深入一线开展调研，全年听课</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">30</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">余节，与师生座谈交流</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">10</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">余次，及时解决师生急难愁盼问题。工作中坚持实事求是、求真务实，不搞形式主义、官僚主义，以务实作风推动各项工作落地见效。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">六、存在不足与改进方向</span></strong></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（一）存在不足</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">德育与体艺教育的融合度有待提升，部分体艺活动的德育内涵挖掘不够深入，活动育人的协同效应未充分发挥；</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">党风廉政建设的创新性不足，廉政教育形式较为传统，对青年教师、学生干部的廉洁教育针对性不强；</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">学生常规管理的精细化程度仍需提高，个别班级在行为规范养成上还有短板，不同年段间的均衡性需进一步优化；</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">4.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年段管理中对“四特”学生的精准帮扶机制仍需完善，针对高二年级学业分化的个性化指导力度不足；</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">纪检监督工作的精准性和实效性有待提升，对隐性廉政风险的排查和防控力度需进一步加大。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（二）改进方向</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">深化五育融合，挖掘体艺活动中的德育元素，打造“体艺</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">+</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">德育”特色活动品牌，推动德育与体艺教育深度融合，提升活动育人实效；</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">创新党风廉政建设形式，针对青年教师、学生干部等不同群体设计个性化廉洁教育内容，打造清廉校园文化精品，增强廉政教育的吸引力和感染力；</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">持续抓实学生常规管理，建立“常态化督查</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">+</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">动态帮扶”机制，针对薄弱班级开展专项指导，推动三个年段管理质量均衡提升，让良好行为习惯融入学生学习生活；</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">4.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">优化年段管理策略，聚焦高二年级学业分化特点，完善“四特”学生精准帮扶机制，加强家校社协同，构建“个性化指导</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">+</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">全方位关爱”体系，助力学生平稳度过关键期；</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">强化纪检监督效能，聚焦廉政风险防控关键点，健全常态化排查与动态防控机制，创新监督方式方法，提升监督的精准性和实效性，持续巩固省级清廉学校建设成果。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">回顾</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2025</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年，虽取得一定成绩，但也清醒认识到自身不足。今后，我将以更饱满的热情、更务实的作风，不忘初心、牢记使命，踏踏实实补短板、强弱项、提质效，为绍兴一中高质量发展、为绍兴教育扩优提质作出更大贡献！</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"> </span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">
</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正小标宋简体;font-size:29px">202</span><span style=";font-family:方正小标宋简体;font-size:29px">5</span><span style=";font-family:方正小标宋简体;font-size:29px">年度述职述廉述德述法报告</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:40px"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体">绍兴市第一中学副校长</span><span style="font-family:楷体">朱水军</span></span></p><h6 style="text-align:center"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 21px">2026年2月</span></h6><p style="text-indent:37px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:32px"><span style=";font-family:楷体;font-size:19px"> </span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2025</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年是我教书育人的第</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">27</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">个年头，也是我自</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2022</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年调任越州中学后又回归一中的首年。上半年服从组织安排，我挂职绍兴一中副校长，分管党建、行政、人事、宣传、信访、校园文化建设、校友会基金会等工作，下半年调入一中后，在原分管工作基础上增加分管财务、工会等工作。一年来，在全校教职员工的大力支持下，我当参谋、做助手、带队伍，协助学校主要领导做好各方面工作，较好地履行了自己的岗位职责。现总结汇报如下：</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:黑体">一、坚持</span><span style="font-family:黑体">学思践悟</span><span style="font-family:黑体">，以高质量党建引领高质量发展</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">坚持党建为重，深入学思践悟，以高质量党建引领高质量发展。认真学习党的理论知识，认真学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想和党的二十届四中全会精神，深入开展</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“八项规定”专题学习教育，深刻领悟“两个确立”的决定性意义，坚决做到“两个维护”，严守政治纪律和清廉规矩，不断提升自身理论素养和政治觉悟，为加快推进教育强市兴校贡献自己的力量。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">全年参与党委理论中心组集中学习</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">29</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">次，</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">坚持学思践悟、学以致用。完成校党委委员增选和六个支部的换届选举，定期召开支部书记例会，推进基层组织规范化建设。探索</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“互联网</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">+</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">党建”新模式，认真开展每月主题党日活动和八项规定学习教育，拓展“养新”党建品牌内涵。设立“一中骄傲”“爱在一中”等栏目，利用微信公众号广泛宣传一中党员名师的先进事迹和一中校友回馈母校的爱心善举，营造校庆筹备氛围，提升办学品牌品位。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">二、坚实主责主业，尽心尽职做好分管工作</span></strong></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">一是行政工作稳中求进。</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">协助推进学校集团化办学探索，建立龙山书院管委会，明确人员和职责分工。协助龙山高级中学筹建，参与师资筹备。做好龙山书院的师资招聘和校园文化建设，梳理核心理念文化，设计制作学校</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">LOGO</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">和校园文化标识标牌与楼名路名。协助市教育局做好</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2026</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年市直学校新教师招聘场地、会务的统筹安排，招聘化学、地理、心理健康三门学科新教师</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">人。召开教代会，平稳完成三年一次的“县管校聘”工作。此外，还做实做好</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2025</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年处室中层干部选聘和培训、年级管委会优化调整和人员选聘、教师职称评聘、小岗晋升、年度考核、评先评优、信访慰问等事关学校发展和教工切身利益的常规工作，助力学校高质量特色发展。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">二是财务工作解困破题。</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">针对公用经费、绩效和编外人员工资在</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2025</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年度均出现严重不足的困难，想方设法解困纾难。对内节约用度、对外开源增资。通过制定</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2026</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年度各处室公用经费预算并严格实施执行，来确保经费使用的规范、可控。通过调整优化绩效列支项目和增加基金会奖教奖学的力度，来提升绩效使用的效益与效能。通过发动校友的爱心捐赠赞助，增加基金会收入，来充实学校的经费保障。但在当前财政紧张的形势下，解困破题的工作难度大、压力重、阻力多，需要各处室、年级和全校上下的齐心协力，共同努力。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">三是</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">工会活动温暖人心。</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">加强工会自身建设，围绕学校中心工作，以师德建设为核心，以维护教职工合法权益为主线，以各种文体活动为载体，同心同向，在促进学校的发展、稳定和营造温暖、和谐、幸福校园中发挥了应有作用。本年度开展了庆祝三八节活动、运动会教职工跳长绳接力比赛、春秋游、迎新登会稽山、暑期疗休养、困难党员职工慰问等，丰富课余生活、提升幸福指数。</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">12</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">月顺利完成工会委员会换届选举。学校工会被评为</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2025</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年度绍兴市教育系统教职工羽毛球比赛优秀组织奖。工会“校友榜样的育人实践”校级文化项目被评为“浙江省教育工会重点培育的校级教职工文化金品牌”。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">四是校庆筹备开局良好。</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">提前谋划学校</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">130</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">周年校庆筹备，制定相关方案和经费预算。利用元旦假期召开校友会暨教育基金会工作会议，邀请</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">80</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">届校友王卫列和老校长朱雯分别担任校友会会长和基金会理事长。平时积极联系、拜访校友，发动校友爱心捐赠，共商校庆筹备大计。一年来，在校友的大力支持下，新增赞助有“绍兴一中越民奖学金之‘高考突出贡献奖’与‘育人楷模奖’”“绍兴一中教育集团恺正基金”“绍兴一中教育集团裘菊兰基金”“绍兴一中教育集团美育基金”“绍兴一中教育集团锐趣科技基金”等项目，捐赠总金额超</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">300</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">万元。此外，还有不少校友定向捐赠</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">130</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年校庆活动项目如校庆画册编辑出版费用、校友录编辑出版费用、校庆服装和礼品费用等，一中学子情系母校、感恩图报的高风亮节令人感动，也为校庆的顺利筹备奠定良好开局。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">五是年级管理规范有序。</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">根据学校工作安排，下半年起我兼任高一年管会主任，分管高一年级。针对新教师多、新班主任多的现实情况，统筹推进年级教育教学各项工作。严格军训和起始教育，营造良好的学风班风。首推实行月考制度，抓实早读晚修质量，促进教学质量提升。做好学法指导，帮助学生适应高中学习和合理完成</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">7</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">选</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">”选课分班。强化团队建设，配合德育处做好年轻班主任的培训培养。致力新教师的专业引领，积极推门听课，对包括龙山书院在内的所有新教师都进行了现场听课，共</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">22</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">节，并召开新教师会议作了专门反馈。半年来，高一年级整体上规范有序、张驰有度，年级团队上下合心、干劲充足，为实现高考“特控破千”目标打下了良好基础。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">三、坚守廉洁自律，清白为人清正做事</span></strong></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">作为一名党员干部，我时刻牢记党的宗旨，自觉增强党性觉悟，平时遵纪守法，提升个人师德师能，加强廉政风险防范，做到大事讲原则，小事讲风格。努力坚守清白做人、清正做事的底线红线。</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">我严格按照党的廉洁从政的要求，认真落实廉政监督责任制，自觉接受群众监督。清白做人，清正做事，清净从教。在个人财产房产、出国境证照管理、因私出国（境）请假、投资理财、银行借贷、严管家属及亲人照顾等廉政风险方面廉洁自律，划清公私的</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“警戒线”，远离法纪的“高压线”，守住个人的“基本线”。做到政治上明白、经济上清白。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">我能够认真履行</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“一岗双责”，牢记个人工作职责。班子成员之间能够做到以诚相待，互相补台而不拆台。做到工作不缺位，用权不越位，做事守本位。平时公道正派，淡薄名利，严谨自律，不搞形式主义，不做面子工程。不管分内分外工作都不推不拖，顾全大局，不计较个人得失。虚心听取老师们的意见，努力为师生服务，不断提升工作水平和能力。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">回顾一年来的工作，有进步也有不足，有成绩也有缺点。衷心感谢全体一中人对我的支持、包容与厚爱！</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2026</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年，让我们一起努力，共同进步。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">
</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">
</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正小标宋简体;font-size:29px">202</span><span style=";font-family:方正小标宋简体;font-size:29px">5</span><span style=";font-family:方正小标宋简体;font-size:29px">年度述职述廉述德述法报告</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:40px"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体">绍兴市第一中学副校长</span><span style="font-family:楷体">冯王亮</span></span></p><h6 style="text-align:center"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-weight: normal;font-size: 21px">2026年2月</span></h6><p style="text-indent:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:19px"> </span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">根据组织要求，现将本人</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2025</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年度履行岗位职责、廉洁自律等方面情况汇报如下，请予评议。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:黑体">一、</span><span style="font-family:黑体">强化理论武装，恪守为党育人初心</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">一年来，本人始终坚持正确的政治方向，深入学习党的教育方针政策和先进教育理论，不断增强政治判断力、政治领悟力、政治执行力。坚持立德树人根本任务，自觉将思想政治工作贯穿于教育教学与管理服务全过程，确保党的教育方针在学校工作中不折不扣得到落实。严格遵守教师职业道德规范和廉洁从教各项规定，时刻自重、自省、自警、自励，筑牢思想防线，保持清廉本色，以高度的政治责任感和饱满的工作热情投身于学校发展事业。</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:黑体">二、</span><span style="font-family:黑体">聚焦主责主业，深耕教学管理一线</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:楷体_GB2312;font-size:21px">（一）潜心教书育人，站稳三尺讲台</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">作为一线物理教师，本年度我承担了高一年级龙山书院提前招录的两个班级的物理教学工作。在教学中，我始终坚持</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“以生为本”，认真钻研新课程标准和教材，精心设计每一堂课，注重激发学生学习兴趣，培养学生科学思维和探究能力。认真批改每一份作业，对作业有问题的学习及时进行面批。积极探索信息技术与学科教学的深度融合，采用多元化教学方法，努力提升课堂教学效率与质量。所教班级学生学习氛围浓厚，物理学科素养得到有效提升，为学生的全面发展奠定了良好基础。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:楷体_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">（二）勇担管理重任，聚力备考攻坚。</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312"> </span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">本年度，我同时又因学校工作需要担任高三年级管理委员会主任，深感责任重大。面对新高考改革的持续深化和社会对绍兴一中的殷切期望，我与高三年级全体教师一道，紧紧围绕</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“科学备考、精准施策、全面提升”的工作思路，开展了以下工作：</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">科学规划，统筹推进。</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"> </span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">牵头制定详实的高三学年复习备考方案以及强基班建设方案，明确各阶段目标、任务与措施，确保复习工作有序、高效。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">精细管理，优化过程。</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"> </span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">加强教学常规检查与反馈，加强与高三年管会的沟通与联络，组织好各类模拟考试与质量分析会，及时发现问题，精准调整教学策略。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">团队协作，激发合力。</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"> </span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">定期召开年级教师会议、备课组长会议、班主任会议，加强沟通协调，营造了团结协作、积极向上的备考氛围。关注师生身心健康，适时开展心理疏导与减压活动。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">4.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">家校联动，凝聚共识。</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"> </span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">积极搭建家校沟通桥梁，通过家长会、个别交流等形式，及时反馈学生情况，争取家长的理解与支持，形成教育合力。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">在全年级师生的共同努力下，我校高三年级在</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2026</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">月的首次选考（首考）中取得了较为优秀的成绩，实现了预期的阶段性目标，为后续高考冲刺奠定了坚实基础。这份成绩的取得，是全体高三教师辛勤付出、全体高三学子奋力拼搏的结果。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px"><span style=";font-family:楷体_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">（三）履行分管职责，服务学校全局。</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312"> </span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">作为分管教学的副校长，我积极协助校长统筹全校教学工作。参与学校教学发展规划的制定与实施，关注课程建设与课堂教学改革，推动教科研活动深入开展，加强青年教师培养，努力促进学校教育教学质量的整体提升。</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:黑体">三、</span><span style="font-family:黑体">严守纪律规矩，永葆清正廉洁本色</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">一年来，我始终将党风廉政建设责任扛在肩上、落实在行动中。</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">严格遵守廉洁自律规定。</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"> </span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">认真落实中央八项规定及其实施细则精神，带头抵制各种不正之风。在职务晋升、评优评先、招生考试、物资采购等工作中，坚持原则，按制度办事，自觉接受监督，未发生任何违规违纪行为。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">认真履行“一岗双责”。</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"> </span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">在抓好业务工作的同时，注重加强对分管领域党员干部和教师的廉洁教育与管理监督，经常开展谈心谈话，提醒大家绷紧廉洁之弦，营造风清气正的育人环境。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">自觉规范个人言行。</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"> </span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">注重家风建设，管好亲属和身边工作人员。主动报告个人有关事项，自觉净化社交圈、生活圈、朋友圈，保持艰苦奋斗、勤俭节约的作风。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:黑体">四、</span><span style="font-family:黑体">反思存在问题与今后努力方向</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">回顾过去一年的工作，虽然取得了一些成绩，但也清醒地认识到自身存在的不足：一是在理论学习与教育教学改革前沿的结合上，深度和系统性有待加强；二是在管理工作的精细化、创新性方面还有提升空间；三是在深入一线了解师生个性化需求方面，还需要投入更多时间和精力。</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">展望未来，我将：</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">持续加强学习，提升履职能力。</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"> </span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">不断更新教育理念，深化对新高考、新课程的研究，提高教学指导与管理水平。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">勇于改革创新，优化管理效能。</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"> </span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">聚焦教育教学质量提升的核心环节，探索更科学、高效的管理模式与方法。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">深入联系师生，改进工作作风。</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"> </span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">更多地深入课堂、深入教研组、深入师生中间，倾听心声，解决实际问题。</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">4.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">永葆廉洁底色，筑牢思想防线。</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"> </span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">始终把纪律和规矩挺在前面，以身作则，清白做人，干净做事。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">新的一年，我将以更加昂扬的斗志、更加务实的作风，恪尽职守，锐意进取，与全体同仁一道，为学校的内涵发展与品质提升贡献自己的力量！</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:38px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">
</span>
</p><p style="text-align: right;">
</p>
    
